---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Erudite Residency">
  <section class="page-hero"><img src="/images/team-squad.jpg" alt="Erudite players standing together" width="3888" height="2592" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="page-overlay"></div><div class="container page-title"><p class="eyebrow">A pathway built around the player</p><h1>Erudite<br/>Residency</h1><p>A focused environment for football development, academic direction, and personal growth.</p><a class="btn" href="/apply">Ask about residency <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">More than a place to train</p><h2>Build a strong<br/>foundation.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Residency brings the daily rhythm of a football pathway into focus: purposeful training, learning, and the people who help a young player stay on course.</p><p>The academy works with players and families to understand their goals and interests. We encourage every family to ask questions about the program, expectations, schedule, and support before taking the next step.</p><div class="accent-rule"></div><a class="link-arrow" href="/academics">See our academic approach ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">A day shaped by purpose</p><h2>Train. Learn.<br/><span>Keep growing.</span></h2><div class="features"><article><span>On the pitch</span><h3>Football development</h3><p>Technical work, game understanding, fitness, and the habits of a good teammate.</p></article><article><span>In every setting</span><h3>Personal growth</h3><p>Confidence, respect, commitment, and responsibility are part of the player’s journey.</p></article><article><span>Beyond football</span><h3>Academic direction</h3><p>Education remains part of the conversation as players plan their next steps.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container callout"><h2>Curious about the pathway?</h2><p>A parent or guardian can send an enquiry and the academy team can share the current details.</p><a class="btn" href="/apply">Make an enquiry ↗</a></div></section>
  <style>.page-hero{min-height:600px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.page-hero>img,.page-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.page-overlay{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#091a37ed,#091a3785 52%,#091a3720)}.page-title{position:relative;padding:5rem 0}.page-title .eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}.page-title h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,10vw,8rem)}.page-title>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#e0e6ee;max-width:31rem;font-size:1.05rem}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem}.lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--ink)}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2rem;margin-top:3rem}.features article{border-top:1px solid #ffffff55;padding-top:1rem}.features article>span{font-size:.67rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--gold)}.features h3{margin-top:1rem}.callout{text-align:center;max-width:750px}.callout p{margin-inline:auto;max-width:500px}.callout .btn{margin-top:1rem}.section-dark h2 span{color:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:700px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.5rem}.features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.2rem}.page-hero{min-height:520px}}
  </style>
</SiteLayout>
